ch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"title":"Swami","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swami","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami"}}}